Live2D rendering (Rust baseline)
================================================================================

- The Rust baseline renders via Ayagami (MIT OR Apache-2.0) and wgpu.
  It does not bundle Live2D Inc. Cubism proprietary Core / Web Core.
- Do not commit Cubism proprietary binaries into this repository. If you obtain
  them yourself, they remain under Live2D’s Proprietary Software License:
  https://www.live2d.com/eula/live2d-proprietary-software-license-agreement_en.html

